{"seq":9,"slug":"heritage-conservation","title":"建筑遗产保护与修复","stage":"DONE","category":"architecture-urban","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 建筑遗产保护与修复\n\n一座存留数百年的木构殿堂、一段斑驳的夯土城墙、一片仍有人居住的历史街区，它们共同的特征是不可再生：一旦原物消失，任何复制品都无法补回那段凝结在材料、工艺与场所之中的历史信息。建筑遗产保护的全部学理，正建立在这一前提之上——把历史建筑当作一种会随时间损耗、且无法重新生产的文化资源，用尽可能科学、克制而可追溯的方式延续它的寿命与意义。\n\n这个 hub 围绕一条完整的工作链组织内容，四个章节恰好对应保护实践从「为什么保」到「保什么」再到「怎么保」与「长久地保」的递进。\n\n第一章「理论与价值」回答最根本的问题：遗产凭什么值得保护、保护的究竟是哪一部分价值。从 Riegl 的价值类型学出发，经由威尼斯宪章到奈良文件对原真性的重新界定，最后落到遗产登录制度与价值评估的具体方法。这一章为后续所有技术决策提供判断尺度——任何干预的合理性，最终都要回到「它是否守护了被识别出来的价值」。\n\n第二章「调查与诊断」是动手之前的认识阶段。不了解一座建筑的几何形态、材料构成、病害成因与结构状态，任何修复都是盲目的。这一章串起勘察测绘与数字化记录、材料劣化机理诊断、结构评估与抗震性能三条线，强调「诊断先于处方」的医学式逻辑。\n\n第三章「干预与技术」进入真正的修复行为。它以最小干预、可逆性、可识别性等修复原则为约束框架，展开传统材料与工艺的相容性修复，以及结构加固与适应性再利用这两类最常见也最易引发争议的干预。技术在这里始终服从于第一章确立的价值判断。\n\n第四章「管理与当代议题」把视野从单体建筑扩展到长期的、制度化的守护。预防性保护与监测把保护从「抢救式修复」转向「日常照护」；遗产地管理与世界遗产体系处理跨尺度的治理；数字遗产与气候风险则面对这个时代最新的两重挑战——如何用数字手段永久留存信息，以及如何应对正在成为遗产头号威胁的气候变化。\n\n四条主线层层咬合：价值决定保什么，诊断弄清真实状态，技术实施克制的干预，管理保证守护的可持续。读者可以顺序通读建立全局认识，也可以按当前面对的具体问题直接进入某一章。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theory-values","title":"理论与价值","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/theory-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"heritage-value-theory","title":"遗产保护的价值理论","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/theory-values/heritage-value-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"charters-and-authenticity","title":"国际宪章与原真性（威尼斯宪章·奈良文件）","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/theory-values/charters-and-authenticity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"listing-and-assessment","title":"遗产登录与价值评估","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/theory-values/listing-and-assessment"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"survey-diagnosis","title":"调查与诊断","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/survey-diagnosis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"survey-documentation-digital","title":"历史建筑勘察、测绘与数字化记录","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/survey-diagnosis/survey-documentation-digital"},{"seq":2,"slug":"material-deterioration-diagnosis","title":"材料劣化机理与病害诊断","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/survey-diagnosis/material-deterioration-diagnosis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structural-assessment-seismic","title":"结构评估与抗震性能","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/survey-diagnosis/structural-assessment-seismic"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"intervention-techniques","title":"干预与技术","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/intervention-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"restoration-principles-minimal-intervention","title":"修复原则与最小干预","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/intervention-techniques/restoration-principles-minimal-intervention"},{"seq":2,"slug":"traditional-materials-craftsmanship","title":"传统材料与工艺修复","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/intervention-techniques/traditional-materials-craftsmanship"},{"seq":3,"slug":"strengthening-adaptive-reuse","title":"结构加固与适应性再利用","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/intervention-techniques/strengthening-adaptive-reuse"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"management-contemporary","title":"管理与当代议题","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/management-contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"preventive-conservation-monitoring","title":"预防性保护与监测","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/management-contemporary/preventive-conservation-monitoring"},{"seq":2,"slug":"heritage-management-world-heritage","title":"遗产地管理与世界遗产体系","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/management-contemporary/heritage-management-world-heritage"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-heritage-climate-risk","title":"数字遗产与气候风险","url":"/h/architecture-urban/heritage-conservation/management-contemporary/digital-heritage-climate-risk"}]}]}